What are logits and probabilities?
This is an important interview topic.
After processing the input through its Transformer layers, the model produces logits — raw scores for possible next tokens.
The model converts these scores into probabilities, commonly using a function called softmax.

Model output
Logits
[4.0, 2.0, 1.0]

Softmax
Converts scores into probabilities

Token A
84%

Token B
11%

Token C
5%

Illustrative probabilities; actual values depend on the model and input.
---------------------------------------------------------------------
What is temperature?
Temperature controls how sharply or broadly the token probabilities are distributed during generation.
